topic: wake
help: "Coordinator wake episodes (#240a): show every wake sidecar and the exact boundary of the outstanding work; consume one boundary after reading it; reconcile a prepared, interrupted, or replaced-occupant episode; never resends"
arguments: []
subcommands:
  show: "Every wake sidecar with its episode, phase, generation, coverage and receipts, the boundary token over the current open obligations to that coordinator (with explicit omissions), and uncoalesced legacy prompts; writes nothing"
  consume: "Coordinator only: record the exact consume receipt for one boundary after reading its included work; closes only that episode, answers/applies/verifies/approves nothing, changes no reservation"
  reconcile: "Coordinator only: settle a prepared, interrupted (claimed/intent), or replaced-occupant episode conservatively; never resends, never clears an episode because a process vanished or time passed, never rewrites an unreadable file"
read_only: false
read_only_subcommands[1]: show
